# @display_name@

Generated by Wave Factory starter @starter_version@. Reference effect: smoothed gain,
-60 to +12 dB, mono/stereo, explicit bypass, Unity and Headroom presets.
This is owned product source: preserve parameter indices and plugin identities.

- DSP: `GainProcessor.h`; adapter and UI: `@internal_name@.cpp`.
- State uses iPlug2 parameter serialization; presets use host/delegate restoration.
- System Arial is loaded before controls. Add PNG 1x/2x pairs in `resources/img`
  and TTF files in `resources/fonts`; CMake registers both platform resource sets.
  Use unique resource basenames and explicitly load fonts before controls.
- Full workflow and validation checklist: `../../../docs/plugin-starter-kit.md`.
- Public name: @display_name@; internal name: @internal_name@; AU subtype: @unique_id@;
  manufacturer: WvFy; identity base: @bundle_identifier@.
- Factory reference controls are functional scaffolding; product artwork and listening
  acceptance require a separate product brief. No signing or host readiness is implied.
